abstract: >-
  MISTVERSE (玄枢) — a client-side, privacy-first Chinese metaphysics toolkit. 49 tools across Bazi, Qi Men Dun Jia, Liu Yao, I-Ching, Zi Wei, Tarot, Feng Shui, wellness, cultivation, and 6 in-browser AI masters. Built with uni-app x + Vue 3 + TypeScript.
